# Tau — Intro

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:tau, path: ".."}
])
```

## Start a session backed by the replay provider

```elixir
Application.put_env(:tau, :default_provider, Tau.Providers.Replay)
{:ok, session_id} = Tau.start_session([])
```

## Stream events

```elixir
Tau.send(session_id, "hello")

events =
  Tau.stream(session_id)
  |> Stream.take(20)
  |> Enum.to_list()

events
```

## Inspect persisted JSONL

```elixir
Tau.list_sessions()
```
